{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37973","headline":"与吴子华侍郎同年玉堂同直怀恩叙恳因成长句四韵兼呈诸同年 · 韩偓","name":"与吴子华侍郎同年玉堂同直怀恩叙恳因成长句四韵兼呈诸同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往年莺谷接清尘，今日鳌山作侍臣。\n二纪计偕劳笔研，一朝宣入掌丝纶。\n声名烜赫文章士，金紫雍容富贵身。\n绦帐恩深无路报，语余相顾却酸辛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}